You are surrounded by a vortex of entropic energy that feeds on the timelines of others. Each time you cast a spell random targets in radius 10 begin rapidly aging and decaying, reducing all stats by [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] for 8 turns, stacking up to 10 times.

Up to [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] stacks total will be applied to enemies each cast with a max of 2 stacks on the same target.
